  I was playing pl7, and, having already turned a long sword
into Excalibur (by dipping in a fountain) and increased my luck, 
was praying at an altar, received Hand of Elbereth,
and my Excalibur turned back into an ordinary long sword!

  I tracked the problem down to a piece of newly added code
designed to keep more than one of any named artifact from
being created, and it looks like this is the only situation
that gives trouble, but it will happen every time.  It should
be easy to fix for pl8, but for now the only thing to do is, if
you already have Excalibur, and you're lawful or neutral and want
to pray at an altar, drop Excalibur before you do it.  You can
still get Hand of Elbereth then, though your Excalibur won't be
made blessed and rustproof.

